"with: rukama": "dengan: rukama",
"with: nohama": "dengan: nohama",
"Numerals in all cases": "Angka di semua kasus",
"Numbers 1–4 decline fully. From 5 up, all oblique cases end in -i.": "Angka 1–4 berubah penuh. Mulai 5 ke atas, semua kasus selain nominatif/akusatif berakhiran -i.",
"with two friends": "bersama dua teman",
"in five minutes": "dalam lima menit",
